ey gain courage and combat prowess.","abilities":["Each time an enemy is defeated, gains ATK and ASPD, stacking up to 10 times."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":650,"def":800,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.3}},"knight_territory_hibernator":{"slug":"knight_territory_hibernator","name":"Knight Territory Hibernator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Knight Territory Hibernator.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A commonly seen burly knight whose Knightclub affiliation is unknown, considered rogue. They're often found passed out drunk in dark alleyways, and should be avoided as they demonstrate ferociously violent tendencies when woken up.","abilities":["Remains Standby for a certain period in areas with <no visibility> and does not attack","If visibility is gained on its location, immediately becomes active"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1000,"def":550,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"brassrust_olmer_ingra":{"slug":"brassrust_olmer_ingra","name":"'Brassrust' Olmer Ingra","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Brassrust' Olmer Ingra.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The great knight known as the 'Butcher of the Field'! Convicted several times for acts of brutality, avoided trial several times thanks to corporate contributions! Youngest son of the Ingra family, an ancient knightly lineage! A ruthless fighter who gets stronger with each battle! Olmerrrrrr Ingraaaaaaa!","abilities":["Each time an enemy is defeated, gains ATK and ASPD, stacking up to 10 times."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":65000,"atk":1200,"def":800,"r